[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0010","text":"————朝日"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0020","text":"喏，你掉的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0030","text":"……我不要"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0040","text":"嗯……能详细跟我说说吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0050","text":"……我不想再被人说坏话了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0060","text":"……不用在意的，那种东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0070","text":"就是啊！\n朝日酱做自己才是最好的嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0080","text":"做自己，是什么意思啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0090","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_9999","text":"导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0100","text":"因为想拍朝日酱最像你自己的样子嘛\n像平时那样，想怎么来就怎么来────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0110","text":"────，没事的\n她不是那种会在意这种杂音的人吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0120","text":"被喜欢也好，被讨厌也好，不用去想那些多余的事\n朝日做自己就是最好的，知道了吗──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0130","text":"我……不知道为什么，\n经常被人要求道歉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0140","text":"所以这次我也以为，\n又是那种“该道歉的时候”了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0017","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0150","text":"但是，谁都没有让我道歉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0160","text":"……那是……！\n因为朝日酱……没有做错任何事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0018","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0170","text":"没有做错的话，为什么会被说那么多啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0180","text":"我去看了……\nSNS什么的……虽然看不太懂……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0019","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0190","text":"结果，以前在学校里被人说的那些话，\n上面……写了好多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0200","text":"但、但是……\n最近那种声音已经几乎────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0210","text":"爱依\n────多，还是少，不是这个问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0220","text":"……我以为出了学校，\n就听不到那些声音了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0230","text":"我以为只要远离讨厌的声音，\n不去在意就好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0240","text":"明明是这样想的……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_08_0250","text":"…………不管到哪里，都会追过来的"}]
